<!--
================================================================================
  Dopamine.DES  -  MASTER DISPLAY FILE
  Dopamine Reward-Learning & Addiction display package for HumMod

  Drives the user interface for DopamineSystem.DES (structure/calculation).
  It declares the shared display objects (menu tree + parameter lists) and
  then includes the individual panel files.

  PANELS (functional grouping):
    1. Dopamine Dynamics   - DA level, tonic/phasic components + DA time-graph
    2. Reward Learning     - ActualReward, RewardPrediction, RPE + RPE graph
    3. Hedonic State       - A / B / Experienced state + opponent-process graph
                             and the long-run hedonic set-point shift
    4. Neuroadaptation     - exposure count + tolerance/sensitization gains
    5. Controls            - user-adjustable model parameters

-->


End
